{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a line through a live puzzle of falling letters, complete wave after wave, and avoid colliding with the boss. With each wave you survive, you\u2019ll unlock capsules containing mysterious lion-dogs called <strong>Mainus</strong>\u2014but don\u2019t get comfortable. Reaching wave 100 is impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Mainu is tied to one of six elements: <strong>Fire, Water, Lightning, Ice, Wind,</strong> or <strong>Wood</strong>. Build a powerful chip deck from your collected Mainus and challenge bosses in tactical battles where smart timing and elemental advantages are key.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Survive brutal waves</strong> of fast-paced puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect 206 unique Mainus</strong>, each with their own element</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Battle bosses</strong> using strategic chip-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>No two runs are the same</strong> \u2014 reflexes and deckbuilding both matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Reaching 100 waves is humanly impossible</strong>\u00a0but try your best.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553610?t=1747085744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553610?t=1747085744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553610/bb8a79b90e6d368bc1add3b8b27716572dbd2deb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747085744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553610/bb8a79b90e6d368bc1add3b8b27716572dbd2deb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747085744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descrip